			"notes": "## Stockpile 0.3.3\n\nFixes the local browser dashboard failing to load in 0.3.2.\n\n### Fixed\n- The local server now serves both recipe modules required by the dashboard.\n- Added a dependency-loading regression check against the packaged mod JARs.\n\n### Added\n- `/stockpile open` opens the dashboard directly without changing your auto-open preference.\n- Dashboard chat messages now include **Copy link** for opening the address manually.\n\n### Update\nReplace the old Stockpile JAR with the build matching your Minecraft version, restart Minecraft, join your world and run `/stockpile open`.\n\nCompatible with **Fabric for Minecraft 26.2 and 26.3**. Requires Fabric Loader 0.20.1+ and Fabric API matching your Minecraft version. Install one matching Stockpile JAR.\n\nBoth builds pass server, browser-module, command, settings and render regression checks. Automatic browser opening remains off by default."
		},
